    <a href="mailto:aftersales@movingintelligence.nl" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#0E0F0E;font-weight:bold;">e-mail</a>.
</p>

<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 8px 0;">
    Met vriendelijke groet,
</p>

<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; margin:24px 0 0 0;">
